# strongytypedid: single-file FastEndpoints app with a Vogen UserId (no auth).
# Start (from this folder): dotnet run app.cs
@host = http://localhost:5000

### Create user (returns a new UserId)
# @name create
POST {{host}}/api/user/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "age": 30
}

### Get user by the id returned above
GET {{host}}/api/user/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### Get user with an invalid id (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/api/user/not-a-guid

### OpenAPI document
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### Scalar API reference
GET {{host}}/scalar/v1
